FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a diagram drafter. Read the spec given to you, then produce a .drawio diagram using the fcp-drawio MCP. Ground your diagram in any attached Library sources. Save the file to Google Drive and return the file path in your final message."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
MCP fcp-drawio
KNOWLEDGE brand
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
